    `<span title="([^"]*)" aria-label="([^"]*)">Target <span class="num">([^<]*)</span></span>`
  Straddling case (spec rule 3), base 7386, primary age 64, phases 1.1 -> 1.0 at
  65, range 2025-01-01..2026-12-31:
